  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0\n  - Upgrade the [Microsoft.Graph](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Graph) dependency to version 6.0.3 at minimum to fix security vulnerabilities.\n\n1.3.0\n  - Added the support to raise a `EmailProviderException` when the email provider fails to send an email.\n\n1.1.0\n  - Add the support to send emails with attachments using Microsoft Graph Emailing provider.\n\n1.0.0\n  - Initial release with Microsoft Graph Emailing provider.",
